# Normalize text files to LF in the repo; Git still checks them out as
# CRLF on Windows if core.autocrlf=true, but the stored/diffed content
# stays consistent across machines. (sync.sh/sync.ps1 also strip \r
# before hashing, so a CRLF checkout can't spuriously bump the
# service-worker cache version on its own.)
* text=auto eol=lf

*.png binary
*.ico binary
*.webmanifest text eol=lf
